sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend Canister
    participant C as Cache Manager
    participant I as IPFS Gateway
    participant P as Pinata API
    participant II as Internet Identity
    participant CL as Client Library

    %% Authentication Flow
    U->>F: Access CanisterDrop
    F->>II: Request Authentication
    II->>F: Return Principal
    F->>B: Verify Principal
    B->>F: Authentication Success

    %% File Upload Workflow
    U->>F: Drag & Drop File
    F->>B: upload_content(cid, content_type, content)
    B->>B: Validate File & Check Tier
    B->>C: Check Cache Limits
    C->>B: Cache Status & Limits
    
    alt Tier Limit Exceeded
        B->>F: Return Tier Limit Error
        F->>U: Show Upgrade Prompt
        U->>F: Confirm Upgrade
        F->>B: upgrade_tier(target_tier)
        B->>B: Process Cycles Payment
    end
    
    B->>B: Process Image On-chain
    B->>C: Store in LRU Cache
    C->>B: Cache Confirmation
    
    B->>P: HTTP Outcall: upload_to_pinata()
    P->>B: Return IPFS CID
    B->>F: Return Upload Success
    F->>U: Show Success & Share Link

    %% Content Delivery Workflow
    U->>F: Request Content by CID
    F->>B: get_content(cid)
    B->>C: Check Cache for CID
    
    alt Cache Hit
        C->>B: Return Cached Content
        B->>C: Update LRU Position
        B->>F: Return Content
        F->>U: Display Content
    else Cache Miss
        C->>B: Cache Miss
        B->>I: HTTP Outcall: fetch_from_ipfs(cid)
        I->>B: Return IPFS Content
        B->>C: Store in Cache
        C->>B: Cache Confirmation
        B->>F: Return Content
        F->>U: Display Content
    end

    %% Image Resizing Workflow
    U->>F: Request Image Resize
    F->>B: get_content_with_resize(cid, width, height)
    B->>C: Check Cache for Original
    
    alt Original in Cache
        C->>B: Return Original Image
    else Original Not in Cache
        B->>I: HTTP Outcall: fetch_from_ipfs(cid)
        I->>B: Return Original Image
        B->>C: Cache Original
    end
    
    B->>B: Resize Image On-chain
    B->>B: Optimize Quality
    B->>C: Cache Resized Image
    B->>F: Return Resized Content
    F->>U: Display Resized Image

    %% Performance Monitoring Workflow
    U->>F: View Performance Dashboard
    F->>B: get_cache_performance_metrics()
    B->>C: Get Cache Statistics
    C->>B: Return Metrics
    B->>F: Return Performance Data
    F->>U: Display Analytics

    %% Client Library Integration Workflow
    Note over CL: External Canister Integration
    CL->>B: upload_asset(content, content_type, cycles)
    B->>B: Validate & Process
    B->>C: Store in Cache
    B->>P: Upload to Pinata
    P->>B: Return CID
    B->>CL: Return Success & CID

    CL->>B: get_asset(cid)
    B->>C: Check Cache
    C->>B: Return Content
    B->>CL: Return Asset

    CL->>B: deposit_cycles(amount)
    B->>B: Process Cycles Payment
    B->>CL: Return Confirmation

    %% Cache Management Workflow
    Note over C: LRU Cache Management
    C->>C: Monitor Cache Size
    alt Cache Full
        C->>C: Evict LRU Item
        C->>C: Update LRU Queue
    end
    
    C->>C: Update Access Timestamps
    C->>C: Maintain Hit/Miss Statistics

    %% Error Handling Workflow
    alt HTTP Outcall Failure
        B->>F: Return Error Response
        F->>U: Show Error Message
    end
    
    alt Cache Eviction Required
        C->>B: Notify Eviction
        B->>F: Update Cache Status
        F->>U: Show Cache Warning
    end

    %% Tier Management Workflow
    U->>F: Request Tier Upgrade
    F->>B: get_user_tier_info()
    B->>B: Get Current Tier
    B->>F: Return Tier Information
    F->>U: Show Upgrade Options
    
    U->>F: Select New Tier
    F->>B: upgrade_tier(new_tier)
    B->>B: Calculate Cost
    B->>B: Process Payment
    B->>F: Return Upgrade Success
    F->>U: Show New Tier Status
